%contains: stdout
Backlog fitting preserved mandatory UORA capacity.

%contains: stdout
Capacity-aware exact scheduling selected deterministic 3x52-or-larger service.

%contains: stdout
Bounded deterministic fallback retained the complete fairness prefix and UORA RU.

%contains: stdout
Positive BSR preceded one UNKNOWN probe while known zero was excluded.

%contains: stdout
Equal-RU capped duration survived HE UL plan validation.

%contains: stdout
Negotiated 26-tone/MCS-0 edge limits were enforced before scoring.

%contains: stdout
Thirty 160 MHz candidates used the bounded fallback without truncating maxMuStations.
